      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以她对朋友，对媒体都如此宣告。\n自己才是最强的傻瓜……\n是会成为伟大选手的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b64ce4427542f3c6dd97f26506781b9e9a4a6edc8ecff132ef52febfa3f02014",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5cfe09936162a964b9a9f08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我虽然是个傻瓜",
