    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2c7ce854832fbddc14d6721",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了在“天皇赏（秋）”这历史悠久的比赛上\n跑得比至今所有选手都更快更强，\n今年夏季集训准备了秘密策略。",
      "source_fingerprint": "633b8d8ab599132738b33c4614c8293428fb20f0a961c49dad855877b2c80bed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
