    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86e6d8db6e0ab5f945732a06",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "询问东瀛佐敦的目标后，\n只得到“成为伟大的选手！”\n这种非常含糊的回答。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2170973ad7ba8701f2a7ec0393483fcc114a52fafcde02b20450e626ced19ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048408.json",
      "json_path": [
