    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a21b919d96b68c19189aaebc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但与训练中那轻佻的样子截然不同，\n她的身体在出道战前变得相当紧绷。\n“如果……在正式比赛没法跑好的话……”",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ebb985496b62a5ee24967fde804fb0af9b752b4b01b60a3ca698e4b75795f34",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
