      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员为了东瀛佐敦，\n思考出“希望S”专属的作战策略。\n但她却听得一头雾水。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fca1a441ddd29324d9985070fb43b58023869924e192cdbb384e2ca22bf0463d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
