    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7279a0e0fd0c9ed65baa1dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就变更计划！\n训练员使用更简单的辞汇，\n并让她亲自体验理解作战内容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfc9f13ebec7d42424bf6c2faae3f6345933b4305df708a914d901c0b59ffcf1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
